Moon Child: the keys
====================

  Cursor left/right   walk
  Cursor up           jump (and up in the menus)
  Cursor down         duck, and down in the menus
  Space               fire in world 3; work the switches in world 1;
                      choose in the menus
  Esc                 leave the level, back to the menu
  Mouse               the menu buttons

The game keeps its options (music, sound, keys) and the high score table
in the drawer's User drawer.
